  "scope": "Separate verbose-GC diagnostic cohort. Main-isolate summaries cover the whole process, including model setup, warmups, measured operations, independent checks and JSON serialization. Kernel/service-isolate output is preserved but excluded from main-isolate summaries. Reported event times are rounded VM diagnostics, may describe overlapping GC phases, and their sum is not total stop-the-world pause time. No GC-to-operation attribution or allocated-byte measurement is provided. Instrumented harness timings must not be substituted for the separate normal timing cohort. AOT compilation is outside run cohorts.",
